WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.996
Jenny wasn't sure about letting us hypnotize her.

2
00:00:05.997 --> 00:00:10.347
"Don't worry, it will be fun!" said Josh.

3
00:00:10.348 --> 00:00:15.796
"All you have to do is sit and stare straight ahead," I added.

4
00:00:15.797 --> 00:00:18.738
At last Jenny said okay.

5
00:00:18.739 --> 00:00:22.352
"Maybe it will solve my school problems."

6
00:00:22.353 --> 00:00:27.749
"We need a necklace or something shiny to swing in front of you," I said.

7
00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:33.032
"I'll go get something from my jewelry box," said Molly.

8
00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:39.194
She ran upstairs to her apartment.

9
00:00:39.195 --> 00:00:41.704
A minute later she came back.

10
00:00:41.705 --> 00:00:45.990
She was holding a necklace with a big silver heart.

11
00:00:45.991 --> 00:00:49.064
"Perfect!" I said.

12
00:00:49.065 --> 00:00:53.341
"Now keep your eyes on this heart," I instructed Jenny.

13
00:00:53.342 --> 00:00:57.745
I swung the heart back and forth slowly in front of her.

14
00:00:57.746 --> 00:01:01.204
Jenny followed it with her eyes.

15
00:01:01.205 --> 00:01:05.608
"You're getting sleepy," I said in a soft voice.

16
00:01:05.609 --> 00:01:12.174
"Very, very sleepy."

17
00:01:12.175 --> 00:01:16.522
"Is she hypnotized yet?" asked Molly.

18
00:01:16.523 --> 00:01:21.647
I snapped my fingers in front of Jenny's face. She blinked.

19
00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:26.571
"Not quite," I said. I swung the heart again.

20
00:01:26.572 --> 00:01:29.941
Jenny just sat there, staring.

21
00:01:29.942 --> 00:01:35.438
"I think she's hypnotized now," whispered Josh.

22
00:01:35.439 --> 00:01:39.610
"Jenny!" I said in a loud, commanding voice.

23
00:01:39.611 --> 00:01:43.555
"Tell us why you are having trouble in school!"

24
00:01:43.556 --> 00:01:48.159
Jenny blinked. "Iggy, why are you yelling at me?"

25
00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:51.924
"Jenny, you're not supposed to blink," I said.

26
00:01:51.925 --> 00:01:54.680
"That ruins the spell."

27
00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:56.718
Jenny rubbed her eyes.

28
00:01:56.719 --> 00:01:58.609
"I can't help it.

29
00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:02.458
That swinging heart made my eyes all blurry."

30
00:02:02.459 --> 00:02:05.598
"I'm afraid the trance is broken," I said.

31
00:02:05.599 --> 00:02:07.676
Jenny looked disappointed.

32
00:02:07.677 --> 00:02:10.817
"I was hoping this would work."

33
00:02:10.818 --> 00:02:13.908
"Me too," I said.

34
00:02:13.909 --> 00:02:17.157
"Jenny!" called Mr. Chen.

35
00:02:17.158 --> 00:02:20.876
"It's time to study for your math test."

36
00:02:20.877 --> 00:02:23.614
"Good luck," I said to Jenny.

37
00:02:23.615 --> 00:02:28.841
I felt bad that I had not been able to help her.

38
00:02:28.842 --> 00:02:34.571
The next day at recess, Molly and Jenny wanted to go on the slide.

39
00:02:34.572 --> 00:02:36.912
But I wasn't in the mood.

40
00:02:36.913 --> 00:02:40.186
All the kids in line were yelling and pushing. "Hey,

41
00:02:40.187 --> 00:02:44.804
stop shoving!" yelled a girl to Evan. "I

42
00:02:44.805 --> 00:02:46.268
didn't shove. It

43
00:02:46.269 --> 00:02:51.545
was the kid behind me," said Evan. Soon

44
00:02:51.546 --> 00:02:55.103
Mr. Dalmati blew his whistle. "Recess

45
00:02:55.104 --> 00:02:56.598
is over. Everyone

46
00:02:56.599 --> 00:03:01.221
line up to go inside quietly." "I

47
00:03:01.222 --> 00:03:06.652
dropped my new hair clip," said Jenny, looking around. "And

48
00:03:06.653 --> 00:03:09.868
now I can't find it." "Here

49
00:03:09.869 --> 00:03:14.285
it is," said Molly, leaning over to pick it up. "It

50
00:03:14.286 --> 00:03:16.990
was right under your nose." "Right

51
00:03:16.991 --> 00:03:20.935
under your nose," I thought. The

52
00:03:20.936 --> 00:03:25.375
famous inventor, Mr. Bright, was coming to our school soon. I

53
00:03:25.376 --> 00:03:31.154
had a feeling there was an invention idea right under my nose. But

54
00:03:31.155 --> 00:03:37.952
I couldn't think of what it was. Walking

55
00:03:37.953 --> 00:03:44.384
home after school that day, we passed a new shop, Mom's Bakery. Actually,

56
00:03:44.385 --> 00:03:46.686
we smelled it first. And

57
00:03:46.687 --> 00:03:50.590
did it smell good !

58
00:03:50.591 --> 00:03:55.512
Jenny, Josh, Molly, and I stopped and looked in the window.

59
00:03:55.513 --> 00:04:00.521
It was filled with chocolate brownies, cookies, and frosted cupcakes.

60
00:04:00.522 --> 00:04:05.288
"I wish that was my mom's bakeshop!" I said.

61
00:04:05.289 --> 00:04:09.676
"I'm starving," said Josh.

62
00:04:09.677 --> 00:04:14.292
"My mouth is watering," said Molly.

63
00:04:14.293 --> 00:04:19.841
"But I don't have any money with me."

64
00:04:19.842 --> 00:04:23.046
We went into the crowded bakeshop.

65
00:04:23.047 --> 00:04:28.600
"Number seven is next!" called a man from behind the counter.

66
00:04:28.601 --> 00:04:31.458
A woman stepped up to the counter.

67
00:04:31.459 --> 00:04:33.375
"I have number seven."

68
00:04:33.376 --> 00:04:35.861
She handed the man a ticket.

69
00:04:35.862 --> 00:04:39.708
"I'd like a chocolate chip cookie, please."

70
00:04:39.709 --> 00:04:43.888
The man took the woman's ticket and gave her a cookie.

71
00:04:43.889 --> 00:04:47.516
"Number eight!" he called out next.

72
00:04:47.517 --> 00:04:52.748
I noticed that everyone was holding a numbered ticket.

73
00:04:52.749 --> 00:04:55.529
That's when the idea came to me.

74
00:04:55.530 --> 00:04:58.354
"I've got it!" I cried.

75
00:04:58.355 --> 00:05:01.222
"Got what?" asked Molly.

76
00:05:01.223 --> 00:05:05.084
"An idea for a new invention!" I said.

77
00:05:05.085 --> 00:05:08.288
"And you know what the amazing thing is?"

78
00:05:08.289 --> 00:05:11.377
"What?" said Josh.

79
00:05:11.378 --> 00:05:21.931
I grinned. "The idea was right under my nose!"

